    "title": "Court upholds Rochester's sanctuary city status - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By SMRITI JACOB and DAVID WAZANA ,\n7 hours ago Getting your Trinity Audio player ready... A federal judge has dismissed the Trump administration’s lawsuit challenging Rochester’s sanctuary city policies. Judge Frank Geraci of the U.S. District Court for the Western District of New York granted the city’s motion for dismissal, and ruled that case cannot be amended or refiled. Read full article",
